      "repository": "gordolio/Trio",
      "number": 1763,
      "title": "[Part 1/4] Store therapy profiles in Core Data",
      "body": "Trio gets therapy profiles: named sets of basal rates, ISF, carb ratios and targets that the user can switch between, by hand, on a weekly schedule, or from LoopFollow. This part adds only the storage: the profiles, the active profile, the switch history and the scheduled starts, in one model change with no UI. The live settings files stay the source the algorithm reads, and they always equal the active profile.\n\nTested in the simulator and on an iPhone XS Max with Omnipod DASH (a water-filled pod, not on a body) and a simulated Dana-i, with LoopFollow on a second phone. Not tested in daily use.\n\nThis addresses #805 (multiple therapy profiles).\n\nParts: #1763, #1764, #1765, #1766. Companion: loopandlearn/LoopFollow#833.\n\nScreenshots and recordings from the simulator with invented data.\n\n<table>\n<tr><td width=\"25%\" valign=\"top\"><img width=\"200\" alt=\"01-profile-list-and-scheduled-switches\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/38a9144d-7248-4d02-bade-0f9b1ffd08fb\" /><br><sub>Profiles with scheduled switches</sub></td><td width=\"25%\" valign=\"top\"><img width=\"200\" alt=\"02-profile-detail-weekend\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb493303-b48c-4815-8f58-72a3bbd78a62\" /><br><sub>Profile detail</sub></td><td width=\"25%\" valign=\"top\"><img width=\"200\" alt=\"03-profile-detail-actions\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af99e4b4-2ef2-4f62-9d9d-6e4ef2e01006\" /><br><sub>Activate, rename, delete</sub></td><td width=\"25%\" valign=\"top\"><img width=\"200\" alt=\"04-switch-confirmation\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e6d194c5-02fa-430a-8908-caf6a92b1d03\" /><br><sub>Switch confirmation</sub></td></tr>\n<tr><td width=\"25%\" valign=\"top\"><img width=\"200\" alt=\"05-basal-editor-banner-weekend\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e463776b-0e7a-4629-87a5-ebc6c7bccc1a\" /><br><sub>Basal editor editing a profile</sub></td><td width=\"25%\" valign=\"top\"><img width=\"200\" alt=\"06-delete-confirmation\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/808c38e3-adc0-4c68-9b14-150846a805bf\" /><br><sub>Delete confirmation</sub></td><td width=\"25%\" valign=\"top\"><img width=\"200\" alt=\"07-scheduled-switch-start-editor\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/16c9d7f0-6aeb-489f-8371-e3460f51cdbe\" /><br><sub>Start editor</sub></td><td width=\"25%\" valign=\"top\"><img width=\"200\" alt=\"08-home-active-profile\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7dc0573f-b8fb-45d9-b1b4-014a79e3abb1\" /><br><sub>Home screen: active profile</sub></td></tr>\n<tr><td width=\"25%\" valign=\"top\"><img width=\"200\" alt=\"09-export-settings-therapy-profiles-category\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/70948536-e1cc-4b19-8954-a4ec3e5f20cb\" /><br><sub>Settings Export</sub></td></tr>\n</table>\n\nCreate a profile, switch to it, edit it with the banner\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/11b54c99-e1dd-4650-af48-07a782cc7070\n",
      "labels": [],
      "url": "https://github.com/nightscout/Trio/pull/1763",
      "mergedAt": "2026-11-17T01:19:21Z"
