    {
      "repository": "gordolio/Trio",
      "number": 1764,
      "title": "[Part 2/4] Add therapy profiles with switching and editing",
      "body": "Adds the Therapy Profiles screen, switching, editing with a banner that names the profile, the scheduled starts and the active profile on the home screen. A switch validates against the pump, writes the basal schedule to the pump and only then writes the settings and Core Data, and it is refused while delivery is suspended. A scheduled start waits for a running bolus and retries while suspended. The basal editor matches a stored rate to the nearest supported rate and says when a rate is not supported, which replaces the rounding from #1674.\n\nStacked on #1763; only the last commit is new.",
      "labels": [],
      "url": "https://github.com/nightscout/Trio/pull/1764",
      "mergedAt": "2026-11-17T01:39:54Z"
    },
    {
      "repository": "nightscout/Trio",
      "number": 1764,
      "title": "[Part 2/4] Add therapy profiles with switching and editing",
      "body": "Adds the Therapy Profiles screen, switching, editing with a banner that names the profile, the scheduled starts and the active profile on the home screen. A switch validates against the pump, writes the basal schedule to the pump and only then writes the settings and Core Data, and it is refused while delivery is suspended. A scheduled start waits for a running bolus and retries while suspended. The basal editor matches a stored rate to the nearest supported rate and says when a rate is not supported, which replaces the rounding from #1674.\n\nStacked on #1763; only the last commit is new.",
      "labels": [],
      "url": "https://github.com/nightscout/Trio/pull/1764",
      "mergedAt": "2026-11-17T01:39:54Z"
    },
    {
      "repository": "gordolio/Trio",
      "number": 1765,
      "title": "[Part 3/4] Upload every therapy profile to Nightscout",
      "body": "The profile document carries every profile, the active one as defaultProfile, and the scheduled starts, and each switch is a Profile Switch treatment. Onboarding can import all profiles, also from a profile document uploaded by Loop, so moving from Loop to Trio keeps them. The import takes the active profile from defaultProfile and finds the default entry regardless of case, which may be what #729 ran into.\n\nStacked on #1764; the commit named after this part is the new one. The commit \"Resolve the therapy profile manager once through the app's locked resolver\" is the same fix as in Part 2.",
      "labels": [],
      "url": "https://github.com/nightscout/Trio/pull/1765",
      "mergedAt": "2026-11-18T14:57:30Z"
    },
