      "body": "Fixes the app init running again when the CGM sheet is opened from Home for the first time with Simulator, xDrip or Nightscout as CGM source, or with no CGM set up yet, as well as in a few tests. `TrioApp()` runs the whole `init()`, so `TrioApp().resolver` was starting the app again just to get the resolver. Replaced it with the static `TrioApp.resolver` that is already used in other places.\n",
